%% Phase1 / schedule / MV3-G04b 取消 / 删除定时消息
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/worktrees/sync-event-alignment/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/schedule/mv3-g04b/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/service/messageContainerShared.service.ts::scheduleMessageHandle（'delete' / 'cancel'）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点定时提示条上的删除，待发消息消失，提示条同时消失
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=implemented；helix=full；dual=no；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: cancelSchedule(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_cancel_schedule", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_cancel_schedule", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_cancel_schedule", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 撤掉待发定时消息 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/cancelSchedule
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction schedule + channel + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（channelScheduleCanceled，UPDATE_CHANNEL）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：内存待发对象置 null，MV3-G04d 的 getSchedule 之后必须返回 null；channel.hasSchedulePost === false，提示条消失；接收者侧 events 为空、无状态变化（persona-local，不传播）
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：取消后不得仍能被 getSchedule 读到（残留会让提示条复活并可能到点二次发送）；不得产生 postReceived / channelUpdateByPost（取消不是发送）；Object.entries(patch) 必须先 filter 掉 undefined 再 spread，禁止让 partial patch 把已有本地字段覆盖成 undefined
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：channelScheduleCanceled，UPDATE_CHANNEL；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
